  displayName: Kobold Militia
  role: 0
  description: "Wingless anthropomorphic dragons standing two-thirds the height of a human, in fabric uniforms and carrying rifles: a Kobold Sergeant and 19 Kobold Militiamen. Each is fragile (5 health, no armor, 50% accuracy), but there are twenty of them, they move 20 m (40 m sprinting), and Swarm lets them spread out up to 10 m from their Sergeant. Their Fang Casters (the Draconis name for the Assault Rifle: 4 damage, penetration 1, 20 m) add up to a lot of shots. Infantry can be taken more than once."
